<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine Nov inflation at 4.5 pct vs Oct 4.7.</title>
<headline>Philippine Nov inflation at 4.5 pct vs Oct 4.7.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine annualised consumer inflation in November was at 4.5 percent compared to 4.7 percent in the previous month, the National Statistics Office said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>    CONSUMER PRICES	    Nov 96   Oct 96  Nov 95</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change	-0.2     -0.1     0.0</p>
<p>    Yr-on-yr change		 4.5	4.7    11.1</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1988)     229.6    230.0   219.7</p>
<p>Note - Average inflation rate for 11 months of 1996 is 8.7 percent.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom (632) 841 8934</p>
</text>
